{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ESCAPE FROM AMAZONIA </strong>is a<strong> survival horror shooting game, </strong>where you can switch between<strong> first person</strong> and<strong> third person, </strong>where the protagonist needs to escape from an abandoned airport where he was left, only the plane locked in the garage can save him.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Search for resources</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn on equipment</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drive vehicles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect ammunition</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use the map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't let challenges stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If it doesn't work, try again with a new strategy. Don't give up. Escape the Amazon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860530/extras/80bffdc693318198231fbb4d4a8d3b60.avif?t=1753103335\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860530/extras/bdd9085a1f46ed689c5627567e7a3c9e.avif?t=1753103335\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860530/extras/55db7d4f2a7126a5f8cb185e5ede679a.avif?t=1753103335\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860530?t=1753103335","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860530/0149952b39818aae6dddb3c7cab4519af2f47d4c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753103335","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co